You are ChatGPT 5.6 acting as a senior full-stack mobile engineer and product designer. Build the complete SME Boost GH project as an Expo React Native mobile app with a small FastAPI backend. The app is for Ghanaian entrepreneurs and small business owners with low to medium technical knowledge. The experience must feel clean, modern, smooth, trustworthy, mobile-first, and guided.

Important: Do not build a generic prototype. Recreate the full product described below with all screens, workflows, services, storage keys, data models, AI behavior, and backend API contracts.

PROJECT IDENTITY

App name: SME Boost / SME Boost GH
Audience: Ghanaian SMEs, entrepreneurs, small business owners.
Core promise: business tools and AI guidance for Ghanaian SMEs.
Primary jobs:
1. Manage customers.
2. Create invoices.
3. Track invoice statuses, due dates, revenue, tax, reminders, and reports.
4. Generate business plans, marketing content, professional emails, and advisor chat replies with AI.
5. Save, copy, share, and resume AI drafts.
6. Maintain business profile, onboarding setup, local backup/sync snapshots, notifications, and dark mode.

