Theme:
- ThemeProvider restores @theme_preference.
- Defaults to light.
- Supports toggleTheme and setTheme using NativeWind setColorScheme.

Business data:
- getCustomers/saveCustomers sorted newest first.
- getInvoices/saveInvoices sorted newest first.
- updateCustomer and updateInvoice update updated_at; invoice updates mark sync_status pending_sync.
- getBusinessSnapshot returns customers and invoices.

Tax:
- Ghana taxes:
  - NHIL 2.5%
  - GETFund 2.5%
  - COVID-19 Health Recovery Levy 1%
  - VAT 15%
- Calculate NHIL, GETFund, COVID flat on subtotal.
- VAT is calculated sequentially on subtotal + levies.
- totalTax is sum.
- Round values to two decimals.

Reports:
- Range: 30d, 90d, all.
- Build BusinessReport with invoiceCount, customerCount, paidRevenue, pendingAmount, overdueAmount, paidCount, overdueCount, averageInvoiceValue, recentCustomerCount, collectionRate, statusBreakdown, monthlyRevenue for last four calendar months.

Notifications:
- Generate invoice_due_soon if unpaid invoice due within 3 days.
- Generate invoice_overdue if status overdue or due date has passed.
- Preserve read/dismissed state across regeneration.
- Update invoice reminder_count and last_reminder_at when generated.
- Expose loadNotifications, syncInvoiceNotifications, markNotificationRead, markAllNotificationsRead, dismissNotification, getUnreadNotificationCount.

