AI SERVICES AND BACKEND CONTRACT

Mobile AI base URL:
- process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL, fallback local URL.
- Fetch fresh Firebase ID token with getAuth().currentUser?.getIdToken().
- Send Authorization: Bearer token when available.

Backend:
- FastAPI app title SME Boost Ghana API.
- GET / returns welcome message.
- GET /health returns { status: "ok" }.
- POST /ai/generate:
  - Protected by Firebase bearer token.
  - Request: { type: string, context: object }.
  - For type business_plan: generate concise business plan draft.
  - For type marketing: generate marketing content.
  - For type email: draft professional email.
  - Return { content: string }.
- POST /ai/chat:
  - Protected by Firebase bearer token.
  - Request: { messages: array, business_metrics?: object }.
  - System prompt: AI Sales Assistant/business mentor for SME Boost Ghana. Provide professional, actionable, concise advice for SMEs. Use business metrics only when available and do not hallucinate data.
  - If metrics are provided, include total_customers, total_invoices, overdue_invoices, overdue_amount, revenue.
  - Return { content: string, metrics_used: business_metrics }.
- Use a singleton AsyncOpenAI client.
- Current model can be gpt-3.5-turbo or updated safely, but keep behavior compatible.

